<p>You become better at using your armour to deflect blows and protect your vital areas. Increases Armour value by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 4, 6, 8, 10,</acronym> Armour hardiness by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50%,</acronym> and reduces the chance melee or ranged attacks critically hit you by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 5%, 8%, 11%, 13%</acronym>, assuming heavy mail armour.</p><p>(This talent only provides bonuses for heavy mail or massive plate armour.)</p><p>At level 1, it allows you to wear heavy mail armour, gauntlets, helms, and heavy boots.</p><p>At level 2, it allows you to wear shields.</p><p>At level 3, it allows you to wear massive plate armour.</p><p></p>